(6590816, 982669, 12611, '<td valign="top">That pigeon makes the shot. But now I am hungry for a Spicy McPigeon Sandwich, off the dollar menu.</td>', 'That pigeon makes the shot. But now I am hungry for a Spicy McPigeon Sandwich, off the dollar menu.', '2011-11-09 16:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
