(6590840, 982294, 12611, '<td valign="top">The tree and the path add interest. I love the nonchalant feeling of this shot- and the texture of the leaves wins the day. Glad I took the time to stare.</td>', 'The tree and the path add interest. I love the nonchalant feeling of this shot- and the texture of the leaves wins the day. Glad I took the time to stare.', '2011-11-09 17:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
