(6592919, 983089, 25190, '<td valign="top">This has a very natural feel too it the model fits in well nice and sharp great lighting ..Beautiful done ..Love this</td>', 'This has a very natural feel too it the model fits in well nice and sharp great lighting ..Beautiful done ..Love this', '2011-11-12 12:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
