(6594850, 983133, 136989, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the details of the silhouettes.  I believe the challenge has driven the crop but I am not found of the foreground.  It just seems too much.</td>', 'I love the colors and the details of the silhouettes.  I believe the challenge has driven the crop but I am not found of the foreground.  It just seems too much.', '2011-11-14 18:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594851, 983069, 136989, '<td valign="top">I''m glad I am not where you are... Brrr!  Love the greens and whites. A little busy but nice.</td>', 'I''m glad I am not where you are... Brrr!  Love the greens and whites. A little busy but nice.', '2011-11-14 18:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594862, 983117, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the subjects, the affection is evident. I feel this could be better if it was either more contrasty or softer and dreamy. This way to my eyes the image is a bit midway between the two extremes, even if I guess resolution might play a role and in large print the soft focus would be more evident. Not sure if and how this was post-processed, but sometimes this approach works well for this kind of images: <a href="//www.luminous-landscape.com/tutorials/glow.shtml" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Soft glow effect</a> <br/>Just a suggestion, though.</td>', 'I like the subjects, the affection is evident. I feel this could be better if it was either more contrasty or softer and dreamy. This way to my eyes the image is a bit midway between the two extremes, even if I guess resolution might play a role and in large print the soft focus would be more evident. Not sure if and how this was post-processed, but sometimes this approach works well for this kind of images: Soft glow effect Just a suggestion, though.', '2011-11-14 19:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594934, 983037, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh I adore this one, absolute 10 for sure, and a real ribbon potential.</td>', 'Oh I adore this one, absolute 10 for sure, and a real ribbon potential.', '2011-11-14 20:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594936, 982183, 114285, '<td valign="top">Adorable indeed not sure if it''s in the ''golden ratio'' though it''s a bit too centred, probably should''ve kept it in the f/s, but you never know with the voters do you. Still i do love it.</td>', 'Adorable indeed not sure if it''s in the ''golden ratio'' though it''s a bit too centred, probably should''ve kept it in the f/s, but you never know with the voters do you. Still i do love it.', '2011-11-14 20:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594943, 982864, 94265, '<td valign="top">The shadow of that building is a bit distracting but I suppose couldn''t be helped. Interesting perspective, very candid.</td>', 'The shadow of that building is a bit distracting but I suppose couldn''t be helped. Interesting perspective, very candid.', '2011-11-14 20:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594945, 983135, 94265, '<td valign="top">Since the shot is all about the shoes, I''d have left out the wrist corsage as my eye wants to go to that. Good cropping and exposure though. The blue stands out well.</td>', 'Since the shot is all about the shoes, I''d have left out the wrist corsage as my eye wants to go to that. Good cropping and exposure though. The blue stands out well.', '2011-11-14 20:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594946, 983101, 94265, '<td valign="top">The subject doesn''t dramatically interest me (just personally) but the shot is well-taken enough for me not to mind. Good sharp details, I like the bold colours.</td>', 'The subject doesn''t dramatically interest me (just personally) but the shot is well-taken enough for me not to mind. Good sharp details, I like the bold colours.', '2011-11-14 20:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594948, 982944, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness, I like a well-taken moody portrait. :-) Highlights at and just below the temple are blown a bit but it doesn''t grab my eye right away, so not too bothersome.</td>', 'Nice sharpness, I like a well-taken moody portrait. :-) Highlights at and just below the temple are blown a bit but it doesn''t grab my eye right away, so not too bothersome.', '2011-11-14 20:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594950, 982947, 94265, '<td valign="top">The textures are all too similar in this shot to make anything stand out, this could have perhaps been rectified if the image had been kept in colour. Nice focus and the shapes are interesting but a bit too much the same for me, so a 5.</td>', 'The textures are all too similar in this shot to make anything stand out, this could have perhaps been rectified if the image had been kept in colour. Nice focus and the shapes are interesting but a bit too much the same for me, so a 5.', '2011-11-14 20:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594951, 982405, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, natural shot with lovely colours. I do wish her collar wasn''t in the way of her lower face, as I could imagine she had a very loving expression I''d have liked to see.</td>', 'Very sweet, natural shot with lovely colours. I do wish her collar wasn''t in the way of her lower face, as I could imagine she had a very loving expression I''d have liked to see.', '2011-11-14 20:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594955, 983099, 94265, '<td valign="top">A very simple shot but not boring; I like the texture and grains of the wood, the different angles of the planks. Wouldn''t have worked in colour I think. Nice job.</td>', 'A very simple shot but not boring; I like the texture and grains of the wood, the different angles of the planks. Wouldn''t have worked in colour I think. Nice job.', '2011-11-14 20:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594957, 983079, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very cool set-up and I love her outfit, nice model and light. The neck of the flower looks a wee bit jagged, possibly from sharpening or compression, although the rest of the picture doesn''t suffer from that.</td>', 'Very cool set-up and I love her outfit, nice model and light. The neck of the flower looks a wee bit jagged, possibly from sharpening or compression, although the rest of the picture doesn''t suffer from that.', '2011-11-14 20:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594958, 983072, 94265, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective in this one.</td>', 'Cool perspective in this one.', '2011-11-14 20:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594959, 983133, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, nice warm colours, good DOF and nicely focused silhouettes.</td>', 'I like the idea, nice warm colours, good DOF and nicely focused silhouettes.', '2011-11-14 20:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594961, 983017, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, nice warm colours too.</td>', 'I like the perspective, nice warm colours too.', '2011-11-14 20:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594966, 982669, 94265, '<td valign="top">The crop feels too tight on this one and those dark tree branches distract from the main subject, which I don''t feel is very interesting as it is. Good exposure on the sky though.</td>', 'The crop feels too tight on this one and those dark tree branches distract from the main subject, which I don''t feel is very interesting as it is. Good exposure on the sky though.', '2011-11-14 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594969, 982922, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely Autumn colours and the richness of the red bokeh is nice. Good positioning for the shot of the leaf in front of that wee bit of light breaking through.</td>', 'Lovely Autumn colours and the richness of the red bokeh is nice. Good positioning for the shot of the leaf in front of that wee bit of light breaking through.', '2011-11-14 20:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594973, 982221, 94265, '<td valign="top">Due to the dull colours in this shot, I think it would have benefitted from being brightened up (the highlights could have stood to be raised somewhat without blowing out detail) and stronger sharpness would have been good too to really enhance the strands of the plant. It fits the challenge at least though.</td>', 'Due to the dull colours in this shot, I think it would have benefitted from being brightened up (the highlights could have stood to be raised somewhat without blowing out detail) and stronger sharpness would have been good too to really enhance the strands of the plant. It fits the challenge at least though.', '2011-11-14 20:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594978, 983143, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice complimentary colours, very clever idea too, although I''d have liked to see a more even spread of light, maybe lit from both sides to eradicate that dark shadow on the bottom left.</td>', 'Nice complimentary colours, very clever idea too, although I''d have liked to see a more even spread of light, maybe lit from both sides to eradicate that dark shadow on the bottom left.', '2011-11-14 20:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594982, 982542, 94265, '<td valign="top">Too much of the same colour here (even though the colours are nice) and for me personally it''s not a very engaging subject. Nice light and sharpness though.</td>', 'Too much of the same colour here (even though the colours are nice) and for me personally it''s not a very engaging subject. Nice light and sharpness though.', '2011-11-14 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594986, 982935, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this fits the golden ratio? Still, the mix of colours is really good. The cold blue/green stands out nicely against the warm Autumn colours in the bokeh.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this fits the golden ratio? Still, the mix of colours is really good. The cold blue/green stands out nicely against the warm Autumn colours in the bokeh.', '2011-11-14 20:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594988, 983125, 94265, '<td valign="top">The petal edges look a bit blown out to me. The colours and tones are very pretty though and the focus on the rose''s centre is nice. This will probably ribbon or definitely make the top 10.</td>', 'The petal edges look a bit blown out to me. The colours and tones are very pretty though and the focus on the rose''s centre is nice. This will probably ribbon or definitely make the top 10.', '2011-11-14 20:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594991, 982678, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is but the eyes in this almost look false, like there''s an unusual amount of the whites on show. Strange. It distracts me from the focus a bit. I definitely don''t like the title. I''m not overly keen on the subject personally either but the bokeh and focus on the fingertip are very good.</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is but the eyes in this almost look false, like there''s an unusual amount of the whites on show. Strange. It distracts me from the focus a bit. I definitely don''t like the title. I''m not overly keen on the subject personally either but the bokeh and focus on the fingertip are very good.', '2011-11-14 20:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594995, 983038, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very pretty generally and the colour is gorgeous; a little over-softened for my taste but this would make a great canvas on a wall.</td>', 'Very pretty generally and the colour is gorgeous; a little over-softened for my taste but this would make a great canvas on a wall.', '2011-11-14 20:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
