(6595518, 982613, 94265, '<td valign="top">The contrast is awfully dark and the whole image is a bit noisy, it almost looks like a scanned photo. I''m afraid this is a low-scoring one for me as the quality is poor and I just can''t make out what it is. Might''ve better suited an abstract challenge (with some work.)</td>', 'The contrast is awfully dark and the whole image is a bit noisy, it almost looks like a scanned photo. I''m afraid this is a low-scoring one for me as the quality is poor and I just can''t make out what it is. Might''ve better suited an abstract challenge (with some work.)', '2011-11-15 13:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6595520, 982356, 94265, '<td valign="top">I can just about see a woman''s face but the quality is really poor in this shot; there are artefacts appearing along the bottom, it''s really noisy all over and there is no point of focus. Kinda like looking through a cloud! A low-scorer for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'I can just about see a woman''s face but the quality is really poor in this shot; there are artefacts appearing along the bottom, it''s really noisy all over and there is no point of focus. Kinda like looking through a cloud! A low-scorer for me, I''m afraid.', '2011-11-15 13:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6595525, 983047, 94265, '<td valign="top">The saturation is up way too high, the colours no longer look natural. That blue dot is also really distracting unfortunately. If you hadn''t bumped the blue saturation up to full, it may not have been so eye-grabbing; the ability to alter saturation is a helpful tool and could have enhanced what was probably a pleasant shade of purple, whereas over-use of the tool has overpowered the subject. Less is more. :-)</td>', 'The saturation is up way too high, the colours no longer look natural. That blue dot is also really distracting unfortunately. If you hadn''t bumped the blue saturation up to full, it may not have been so eye-grabbing; the ability to alter saturation is a helpful tool and could have enhanced what was probably a pleasant shade of purple, whereas over-use of the tool has overpowered the subject. Less is more. :-)', '2011-11-15 14:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
