(6595899, 982944, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice title. Fits well with the subject. I like the gritty processing and the high contrast look. I do think there should be more light in the subjects eyes though. I am drawn more to the big bright spot on the side of the head. Overall this has great detail with good edge!</td>', 'Nice title. Fits well with the subject. I like the gritty processing and the high contrast look. I do think there should be more light in the subjects eyes though. I am drawn more to the big bright spot on the side of the head. Overall this has great detail with good edge!', '2011-11-15 21:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
