(6596711, 983129, 49018, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know what to say, I am bit overwheelmed and would rather say nothing, but for sure I can''t :)<br/>I have been on DPC for several years now and, while I very seldom submit anything, I do enjoy occasionally browsing through the archives. So, at some point or the other I have seen and enjoyed talented work from all of you.<br/>Thank you very much for taking time to comment, for the favorites, for the encouragement, I do appreciate it a lot, particularly because I like what you do, even if more often than not I have no clue how you do it or where you get certain ideas.<br/>Well, now I can shut up :)<br/></td>', 'I don''t really know what to say, I am bit overwheelmed and would rather say nothing, but for sure I can''t :)I have been on DPC for several years now and, while I very seldom submit anything, I do enjoy occasionally browsing through the archives. So, at some point or the other I have seen and enjoyed talented work from all of you.Thank you very much for taking time to comment, for the favorites, for the encouragement, I do appreciate it a lot, particularly because I like what you do, even if more often than not I have no clue how you do it or where you get certain ideas.Well, now I can shut up :)', '2011-11-16 18:23:56.000000', NULL, 0),
